      <h1>{{ resort.short }} Resort: <em>The Full Guide</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Fort Wilderness Campground is the tent and RV campground on Bay Lake, not a hotel. Sites are listed as sleeping eight, from a tent or pop-up pad up to larger Premium and Premium Meadow sites. You take an internal bus around the property, then a boat to Magic Kingdom. Trail's End Restaurant and Meadow Snack Bar are on site. The cabins have their own page.</p>
