          <tr><td><strong>Premium Campsite</strong></td><td>Concrete pad up to 18 by 60 feet</td><td>Up to 8 adults</td><td>Larger-style RV; sewage hook-up</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>[Ryan: your take]</td></tr>
