    <p>In 2026, at full price with 12.5% tax included, tent or pop-up sites ran about $82 to $222, Full Hook-Up about $125 to $271, Preferred about $138 to $297, Premium about $148 to $313, and Premium Meadow about $156 to $348, depending on the dates.</p>
