  <section id="dining">
    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Trail's End Restaurant</strong> is the table-service restaurant at the campsites, per Disney's official page. That page listed operating hours of 7:30 a.m. to 9:45 p.m. when we checked, with breakfast, lunch and dinner menus, including a fried-chicken dinner. <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span></li>
      <li><strong>Meadow Snack Bar</strong> is an official quick-service kiosk, with salads, sandwiches, light snacks, frozen treats, beer and sodas. Hours were not listed clearly on the page we opened. <span class="verify">[verify hours]</span></li>
      <li>Other Settlement or Meadow stands may also be open. We did not get clean official pages for guessed slugs, so confirm the current list on Disney's official dining pages. <span class="verify">[verify the full current dining list]</span></li>
    </ul>
