  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <p>The Meadow Swimmin' Pool area is the main pool complex for the campground. Official pool pages we tried did not return a full description, and recent reports described work at that pool earlier in 2026, so we are not quoting slide lengths or a new layout here. <span class="verify">[verify current pool names, hours and features]</span></p>
    <p>Fort Wilderness also has trails, a marina, a beach area, bike and golf-cart rentals, and evening activities. Confirm the current recreation schedule on arrival. Golf carts are a common way to get around; rules and rental details change, so check official information before you assume you can bring or rent one. <span class="verify">[verify current golf-cart rules]</span></p>
