  <section id="booking">
    <h2>Booking and value tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Match the pad size to your equipment before you fall for a lower rate.</strong> Tent and pop-up pads are listed at 10 by 25 feet. Larger RVs need the 18-by-60 Premium or Premium Meadow pads in the 2026 notes.</li>
      <li><strong>Preferred is about being closer to the marina,</strong> not a larger pad than Full Hook-Up. Premium and Premium Meadow are the larger pads.</li>
      <li><strong>If you want walls, a kitchen and beds already in the unit, look at the <a href="/resorts/cabins-at-fort-wilderness-resort/">cabins</a></strong> instead of stretching a tent booking.</li>
    </ul>
